  "rating": 5,
  "text": "I am totally in awe of Heather’s talent! Heather happily travelled from Knoxville, Tennessee to a venue in Springfield, Kentucky to do a live wedding picture during my daughter’s recent wedding to the man of her dreams.  Heather truly captured the love they have for each other as well as the love their closest family and friends have for them. The colors are so vibrant and our guests really enjoyed watching Heather paint during the cocktail hour and after dinner. The newlyweds can not wait to showcase this portrait and a “moment in time” on a wall of their first home together. I honestly feel this is the best gift and “investment” I could have made for their wedding day!",
